# Nix modules

`make fmt` is `nix fmt`; do not hand-fight nixfmt. Host composition lives under
`hosts/`. Shared modules under `config/` and `services/`.

Use `lib.mkOption` with a `description`. Prefer `lib.mkMerge` / `lib.mkIf`
over copy-pasted host blocks.

After-switch restarts for `restartIfChanged = false` units: `deploy.mdc`.

NFS for high-I/O: `services.build-cache` loopback ext4, not raw NFS
(`docs/custom-options.md`). Garage on `proxmox-observability` is iSCSI
(`docs/adr/2026-09-18-garage-iscsi.md`). Sandbox with `BindPaths`, `TimeoutStopSec`,
`SupplementaryGroups` (`keys`, `render`) as neighbouring services do.

A `nix` eval **in this git checkout** only sees tracked files. `git add` new
Nix/Go/Python that a module references or lint fails. rsync to a builder
excludes `.git/`, so that copy is a path flake and sees untracked files.

Eval-time assertions (not `checks.` derivations: `make lint` is
`--no-build`) live in `config/eval-guards.nix`, `config/fleet-apps.nix`,
`config/fleet-inventory.nix`, and the Caddy module. Add one when a freeze
must fail closed
([docs/adr/2026-09-18-eval-time-guardrails.md](docs/adr/2026-09-18-eval-time-guardrails.md)).
